        "text": "French summaries of Bulletin articles, including a review of trade in health services under the General Agreement on Trade in Services, describing mixed effects on equity, efficiency, quality and access and proposing policies on brain drain and public–private links. Another reports low prevalence but high risk behaviour for reproductive tract infections in rural Bangladesh, calling for primary prevention.",
