      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "French summaries of Bulletin articles, beginning with an assessment of five infectious disease surveillance and response systems in the United Republic of Tanzania in 1998. It found that apart from the health management information system they were rarely present, with few standard case definitions and weak reporting and supervision. The page ends with an estimate showing a low risk of vaccine-associated paralytic polio in India.",
